OL,3,GNEWSATreasures hidden in plain sight go
OL,4,Aon display
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree historic treasures have been
OL,7,Freunited and put on display together at
OL,8,Fa museum in Scunthorpe.
OL,10,FA medieval paten ` a plate used for
OL,11,Fholding the bread during a Eucharist `
OL,12,Fand an Elizabethan chalice, which were
OL,13,Fboth from St Mary's Church in
OL,14,FBarnetby-le-Wold, have joined the
OL,15,FBarnetby font on display at North
OL,16,FLincolnshire Museum.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
