OL,3,GNEWSATreasures hidden in plain sight go
OL,4,Aon display
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe historical significance of the
OL,7,Fitems was uncovered after the rector of
OL,8,FBarnetby-le-Wold, the Reverend Lee
OL,9,FGabel, used them during church
OL,10,Flivestreams during the Covid-19
OL,11,Fpandemic, before keeping them in his
OL,12,Foffice.
OL,14,F"We realised these objects really ought
OL,15,Fto be shared with the public," he said.
OL,16,F"They should be seen and appreciated."
